docs {
  # Update Step: Injuries
  
  This endpoint updates information about any injuries that occurred during the incident. 
  **Supports multiple injury records.**
  
  ## Multiple Injuries Format:
  ```json
  {
    "injuries": [
      {
        "id": 123,  // Optional - Include when updating existing injury
        "body_area": "Head",
        "injury_description": "Description of injury",
        "first_aid_given": "yes",  // yes/no
        "hospital_visit_required": "yes",  // yes/no
        "hospital_name": "St. Mary's Hospital",  // Required if hospital_visit_required = yes
        "advice_given": "Medical advice provided",
        "medication_required": "yes",  // yes/no
        "follow_up_appointment": "yes",  // yes/no
        "accident_book_reference": "<p>Internal log reference</p>"
      }
    ],
    "delete_injury_ids": [456, 789],  // Optional - IDs of injuries to delete
    "replace_all": false  // Optional - Replace all existing injuries
  }
  ```
  
  ## Single Injury Format (Backward Compatible):
  ```json
  {
    "body_area": "Head",
    "injury_description": "Description",
    "first_aid_given": "yes"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Body Area Options:
  - No specific location
  - Head
  - Eye
  - Nose
  - Mouth and teeth
  - Neck and throat
  - Shoulder joint and upper arm
  - Elbow joint and forearm
  - Wrist
  - Palm and fingers
  - Genitals
  - Hip and thigh
  - Knee
  - Leg
  - Ankle
  - Foot and toes
  - Neck and shoulders
  - Back
  - Calf
  - Heel
  - Ear
  - Buttocks and anus
  - Abdomen
  - Chest
  - Breast
  
  ## Fields:
  - `body_area` - **Required** - Part of body affected (from list above)
  - `injury_description` - **Required** - Detailed description of injury
  - `first_aid_given` - Optional - Yes/No
  - `hospital_visit_required` - Optional - Yes/No
  - `hospital_name` - Optional - Hospital name if visit required
  - `advice_given` - Optional - Medical advice provided
  - `medication_required` - Optional - Yes/No
  - `follow_up_appointment` - Optional - Yes/No
  - `accident_book_reference` - Optional - Internal accident log reference (supports rich text)
}
